          office is not a different rate from a medical office. We are not
          estimating an adder, and we are not going to invent one.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Setup:</strong> $2,500</li>
          <li><strong>Monthly:</strong> $497 flat, managed service</li>
          <li><strong>Included:</strong> 24/7 call answering in your office's voice, scheduling questions by the rules you write, booking on your real calendar, the escalation list you name, SMS follow-up, call recordings and transcripts, a monthly tuning session</li>
          <li><strong>Not charged:</strong> no per-minute charges and no per-call charges. No clinical advice, and no symptom triage, at any hour.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          The parent price write-up is on the
          <a class="text-link" href="/answering-service-fayetteville-ar/">Fayetteville answering service page</a>.
          The cost comparison against a traditional answering service is on the
